  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0\n- Establish community-maintained releases under the RejectKid.BitsKit package ID.\n- Add .NET 10 support while retaining existing library targets.\n- Add reproducible builds, dependency locking, and automated package validation.\n- Fix incremental source-generator caching and restore the BITSKIT003 diagnostic.\n- Fix inline-array setters for modern C# compiler span overload resolution.\n- Remove EOL .NET 6 and .NET 7 targets and modernize test and benchmark dependencies.\n- Add categorized local and automated benchmark reporting for the library's features.\n\nv.1.2.0\n- Support InlineArrays.\n\nv.1.1.0\n- Add contracts to IO classes.\n- Support Readonly Instance Members.\n- Support Integral Type Casting.\n\nv.1.0.0\n- Initial release.",
